# Files that must never reach a Vercel deployment upload.
#
# Vercel does NOT read .gitignore — its CLI has a fixed default ignore list and otherwise
# uploads the whole working tree. Without this file, `vercel --prod` from a real checkout
# uploads the gitignored credential files (demo-credentials.mfa.local.md holds the demo
# accounts' TOTP secrets) and the QA reports under .gstack/ (applicant PII), and the remote
# build then traces the credential files into server-function bundles. QA 2026-09-11
# (CRITIC-01). next.config.ts's outputFileTracingExcludes is the second layer.
#
# Keep this list to things the build and runtime genuinely do not need. Do NOT add source
# dirs the build reads (the privacy page mirrors docs/privacy/PRIVACY_NOTICE.md by hand, so
# it is not imported — but leave docs/ otherwise untouched to be safe).

demo-credentials.local.md
demo-credentials.mfa.local.md
*.local.md
.gstack
e2e-artifacts
docs/design
